RecordThing.Description:
An {THING:StructureActiveVent} with a bigger pump. It works the same way, with the same modes, pressure settings and power draw, but moves gas several times faster in both directions. In a room bigger than one grid, it also pulls gas from (or pushes it into) the spaces around it, like the {THING:StructurePoweredVentLarge}.

{HEADER:Multiplier}
How much faster is its {COLORORANGE:Setting}: from 1 (as fast as an Active Vent) to 20. A new Fast Vent starts at 5. Set it with a {THING:StructureLogicWriter} or a chip, for example {COLORYELLOW:s d0 Setting 10}. Values outside 1 to 20 are clamped. The vent still stops at its pressure settings, so it slows down as it nears them, like any vent.
